<td><strong>Travel<\\/strong><\\/td><td>XYZ Axis: 180 \\u00d7 110 \\u00d7 100\\u202fmm; A-Axis: \\u00b1361\\u00b0; B-Axis: \\u00b130\\u00b0<\\/td><\\/tr><tr><td><strong>Spindle<\\/strong><\\/td><td>Power: AC 2500\\u202fW; Cooling: Water Cooling; Speed: 60,000\\u202frpm; Chuck Size: \\u03a66\\u202fmm<\\/td><\\/tr><tr><td><strong>Input<\\/strong><\\/td><td>Power Supply: Single-Phase AC 220\\u202fV 50\\/60\\u202fHz; Power: 3\\u202fkW 15\\u202fA; Air Pressure: 6\\u202fBar<\\/td><\\/tr><\\/tbody><\\/table><\\/figure>\",\"packaging\":null,\"warranty\":null,\"category_id\":\"269\",\"delivery_target_days\":\"7\",\"discount\":0,\"actual_price\":\"5000000\",\"sell_price\":\"5000000\",\"available_quantity\":\"4\",\"stock_quantity\":\"4\",\"brand_id\":\"17\",\"product_location\":null,\"has_variations\":0,\"flash_sale\":0,\"weekly_offer\":0,\"special_offer\":0,\"sell_count\":null,\"today_deals\":0,\"main_image\":\"2025-08-05-6891b9e138d36.png\",\"product_catalogue\":null,\"status\":1,\"created_at\":\"2025-08-04 17:15:25\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-01-18 12:33:49\"}', '45.64.160.213', 'Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/143.0.0.0 Safari/537.36', '2026-01-18 12:33:49', '2026-01-18 12:33:49'),
(32, 'System', 'System', 4, 'create', NULL, 'products', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'App\\Models\\Product', 2374, NULL, '{\"product_code\":\"P868337\",\"product_name\":\"DENTAL ZIRCONIA AIZIR APW9812SHT-APMA1 MULTILAYER\",\"slug\":\"dental-zirconia-aizir-apw9812sht-apma1-multilayer-P868337\",\"category_id\":\"314\",\"brand_id\":\"17\",\"delivery_target_days\":\"3\",\"flash_sale\":0,\"weekly_offer\":0,\"special_offer\":0,\"today_deals\":0,\"has_variations\":0,\"product_description\":\"<p>Aizir represents Aidite\'s most advanced R&amp;D and production lever integrating several patented technologies in one disc, mean-while meeting the full range of indications. It has larger systematic processing. a wider sintering temperature range, and an increased stable three-dimensional gradient effect.<\\/p><p><strong>2 Hours<\\/strong><\\/p><p>On the basis of realizing rapid sintering, Aizir is compatible with many kinds of Aidite zirconia materials (such as SHT-PC, SHTM) to achieve simultaneous sintering of multiple materials.<\\/p><p><strong>1510-1570 \\u2103<\\/strong><\\/p><p>Aizir has an ultra-wide sintering temperature range, giving a perfect bionic aesthetic effect at different temperatures.<\\/p><p>Aizir is one incredible material, that can be used in the above systems, but it is also part of an entire digital workflow. From the initial intraoral scan right through to the final restoration, Aidite has validated workflows with equipment and materials for the whole process. Faster production times, higher quality, full technical and engineering support, through our dealers and ourselves, 24\\/7 worldwide. With Aizir, you are not just purchasing any ordinary zirconia disc, but investing in a part of a wider dedicated system, benefitting the whole dental team and their patients. Dentists are requesting an Aizir restoration, once they see the difference.<\\/p>\",\"key_specifications\":\"<figure class=\\\"table\\\"><table><tbody><tr><td>Color<\\/td><td>Vita&nbsp;16&nbsp;colors\\/OM1\\/OM2\\/OM3<\\/td><\\/tr><tr><td>Aesthetic<\\/td><td>Super&nbsp;high&nbsp;translucency<\\/td><\\/tr><tr><td>Flexural&nbsp;strength<\\/td><td>700-1050MPa<\\/td><\\/tr><tr><td>Coefficient&nbsp;of&nbsp;thermal&nbsp; expansion(CTE&nbsp;25-500\\u2103)<\\/td><td>(10.5\\u00b10.5)\\u00d710K<\\/td><\\/tr><tr><td>Chemical&nbsp;solubility<\\/td><td>\\u2264100\\u03bcm.cm-\\u00b2<\\/td><\\/tr><tr><td>Fracture&nbsp;toughness<\\/td><td>\\u22655MPam\\u00bd<\\/td><\\/tr><tr><td>Sintered&nbsp;density<\\/td><td>\\u22656.0g\\/cm\\u00b3<\\/td><\\/tr><tr><td>Vickers&nbsp;ardness<\\/td><td>\\u22651250HV10<\\/td><\\/tr><\\/tbody><\\/table><\\/figure>\",\"packaging\":\"<ul><li>&nbsp;1 x ZIRCONIA AIZIR&nbsp;<\\/li><\\/ul>\",\"warranty\":\"<ul><li>Warranty is not applicable for this product.<\\/li><\\/ul>\",\"main_image\":\"2026-01-19-696dd93e392fd.png\",\"product_catalogue\":null,\"status\":1,\"actual_price\":\"11100\",\"sell_price\":\"11100\",\"available_quantity\":\"10\",\"stock_quantity\":\"10\",\"discount\":0,\"updated_at\":\"2026-01-19 12:56:58\",\"created_at\":\"2026-01-19 12:56:58\",\"id\":2374}', '45.64.160.213', 'Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/143.0.0.0 Safari/537.36', '2026-01-19 12:56:58', '2026-01-19 12:56:58'),
(33, 'System', 'System', 4, 'create', NULL, 'products', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'App\\Models\\Product', 2375, NULL, '{\"product_code\":\"P670774\",\"product_name\":\"DENTAL ZIRCONIA AIZIR APW9812SHT-APMA2 MULTILAYER\",\"slug\":\"dental-zirconia-aizir-apw9812sht-apma2-multilayer-P670774\",\"category_id\":\"314\",\"brand_id\":\"17\",\"delivery_target_days\":\"3\",\"flash_sale\":0,\"weekly_offer\":0,\"special_offer\":0,\"today_deals\":0,\"has_variations\":0,\"product_description\":\"<p>Aidite Aizir Multilayer Zirconia is a high-performance dental zirconia disc engineered for CAD\\/CAM milling of lifelike, monolithic restorations. It features a <i>multi-layer gradient design<\\/i> that transitions from higher strength in the cervical zone to increased translucency in the incisal zone, delivering both durability and natural aesthetics. Ideal for anterior crowns, veneers, inlays\\/onlays, and other esthetic restorations, this A2-shaded disc provides predictable results with excellent shade harmony and superior mechanical properties. Aizir integrates advanced R&amp;D and patented technologies to support a wide sintering range and seamless integration into digital workflows.<\\/p>\",\"key_specifications\":\"<figure class=\\\"table\\\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Specification<\\/strong><\\/th><th><strong>Details<\\/strong><\\/th><\\/tr><\\/thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Product Name<\\/strong><\\/td><td>Aidite Aizir Multilayer Zirconia \\u2013 98\\u00d712 mm (Shade A2)<\\/td><\\/tr><tr><td><strong>Material Type<\\/strong><\\/td><td>Multilayer Zirconia Disc<\\/td><\\/tr><tr><td><strong>Shade<\\/strong><\\/td><td>A2 (VITA Classic)<\\/td><\\/tr><tr><td><strong>Diameter \\u00d7 Height<\\/strong><\\/td><td>98 \\u00d7 12 mm<\\/td><\\/tr><tr><td><strong>Layer Design<\\/strong><\\/td><td>Gradient from cervical (strong) to incisal (translucent)<\\/td><\\/tr><tr><td><strong>Flexural \\/ Bending Strength<\\/strong><\\/td><td>~700\\u20131050+ MPa (high strength cervical, lower translucent incisal)&nbsp;<\\/td><\\/tr><tr><td><strong>Translucency<\\/strong><\\/td><td>Approx. 43\\u201353% (smooth enamel-like appearance)&nbsp;<\\/td><\\/tr><tr><td><strong>Sintering Temperature Range<\\/strong><\\/td><td>~1510\\u20131570 \\u00b0C (wide stable range)&nbsp;<\\/td><\\/tr><tr><td><strong>Sintered Density<\\/strong><\\/td><td>\\u2265 6.0 g\\/cm\\u00b3&nbsp;<\\/td><\\/tr><tr><td><strong>Fracture Toughness<\\/strong><\\/td><td>\\u2265 5 MPa\\u00b7m\\u2070\\u00b7\\u2075&nbsp;<\\/td><\\/tr><tr><td><strong>Vickers Hardness (HV10)<\\/strong><\\/td><td>\\u2265 1250&nbsp;<\\/td><\\/tr><tr><td><strong>Coefficient of Thermal Expansion (CTE)<\\/strong><\\/td><td>(10.5 \\u00b1 0.5) \\u00d710\\u207b\\u2076 K\\u207b\\u00b9 (25\\u2013500 \\u00b0C)&nbsp;<\\/td><\\/tr><tr><td><strong>Indications<\\/strong><\\/td><td>Crowns (anterior\\/posterior), veneers, inlays\\/onlays, small bridges (esthetics zone)&nbsp;<\\/td><\\/tr><tr><td><strong>Compatible Systems<\\/strong><\\/td><td>Open CAD\\/CAM milling and sintering workflows&nbsp;<\\/td><\\/tr><\\/tbody><\\/table><\\/figure>\",\"packaging\":\"<ul><li>1 x ZIRCONIA AIZIR<\\/li><\\/ul>\",\"warranty\":\"<ul><li>Warranty is not applicable for this product.<\\/li><\\/ul>\",\"main_image\":\"2026-01-19-696ddbd33bf35.png\",\"product_catalogue\":null,\"status\":1,\"actual_price\":\"11100\",\"sell_price\":\"11100\",\"available_quantity\":\"10\",\"stock_quantity\":\"10\",\"discount\":0,\"updated_at\":\"2026-01-19 13:07:59\",\"created_at\":\"2026-01-19 13:07:59\",\"id\":2375}', '45.64.160.213', 'Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/143.0.0.0 Safari/537.36', '2026-01-19 13:07:59', '2026-01-19 13:07:59'),
(34, 'System', 'System', 4, 'create', NULL, 'products', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'App\\Models\\Product', 2376, NULL, '{\"product_code\":\"P938629\",\"product_name\":\"DENTAL ZIRCONIA AIZIR APW9812SHT-APMA3 MULTILAYER\",\"slug\":\"dental-zirconia-aizir-apw9812sht-apma3-multilayer-P938629\",\"category_id\":\"314\",\"brand_id\":\"17\",\"delivery_target_days\":\"3\",\"flash_sale\":0,\"weekly_offer\":0,\"special_offer\":0,\"today_deals\":0,\"has_variations\":0,\"product_description\":\"<p>The <strong>Aizir APW9812SHT-APMA3 Multilayer Zirconia Disc<\\/strong> is a premium dental zirconia block designed for CAD\\/CAM systems. It combines high strength with esthetic translucency through a multilayer gradient for natural color transitions \\u2014 mimicking real tooth enamel and dentin. With its optimized mechanical properties and precision shade transitions, it is ideal for esthetic monolithic restorations such as anterior and posterior crowns, bridges, inlays\\/onlays, and veneers. The APMA3 shade offers consistent and predictable color results compatible with standard dental shade guides.<\\/p>\",\"key_specifications\":\"<figure class=\\\"table\\\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Specification<\\/strong><\\/th><th><strong>Details<\\/strong><\\/th><\\/tr><\\/thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Product Name<\\/strong><\\/td><td>Dental Zirconia Aizir APW9812SHT-APMA3 Multilayer<\\/td><\\/tr><tr><td><strong>Model \\/ Code<\\/strong><\\/td><td>APW9812SHT-APMA3<\\/td><\\/tr><tr><td><strong>Material<\\/strong><\\/td><td>High-Strength Multilayer Zirconia<\\/td><\\/tr><tr><td><strong>Shade<\\/strong><\\/td><td>APMA3 (Compatible with A\\/B\\/C\\/D shade ranges)<\\/td><\\/tr><tr><td><strong>Disc Size<\\/strong><\\/td><td>\\u00d898 \\u00d7 12 mm<\\/td><\\/tr><tr><td><strong>Layering<\\/strong><\\/td><td>Multilayer gradient (enamel to dentin zones)<\\/td><\\/tr><tr><td><strong>Flexural Strength<\\/strong><\\/td><td>High (typically \\u2265 700\\u20131000 MPa)<\\/td><\\/tr><tr><td><strong>Translucency<\\/strong><\\/td><td>Enhanced esthetic translucency in incisal layers<\\/td><\\/tr><tr><td><strong>Sintering Range<\\/strong><\\/td><td>Approx. 1500\\u20131570 \\u00b0C (varies by furnace &amp; workflow)<\\/td><\\/tr><tr><td><strong>Fracture Toughness<\\/strong><\\/td><td>Elevated for durable restorations<\\/td><\\/tr><tr><td><strong>Indications<\\/strong><\\/td><td>Crowns, small bridges, veneers, inlays\\/onlays<\\/td><\\/tr><tr><td><strong>Compatible With<\\/strong><\\/td><td>CAD\\/CAM Milling and Standard Dental Sintering Furnaces<\\/td><\\/tr><tr><td><strong>Key Benefits<\\/strong><\\/td><td>High strength + esthetics, smooth milling, stable sintering, predictable shade match<\\/td><\\/tr><\\/tbody><\\/table><\\/figure>\",\"packaging\":\"<ul><li>1 x ZIRCONIA AIZIR<\\/li><\\/ul>\",\"warranty\":\"<ul><li>Warranty is not applicable for this product.<\\/li><\\/ul>\",\"main_image\":\"2026-01-19-696ddc5e834a6.png\",\"product_catalogue\":null,\"status\":1,\"actual_price\":\"11100\",\"sell_price\":\"11100\",\"available_quantity\":\"10\",\"stock_quantity\":\"10\",\"discount\":0,\"updated_at\":\"2026-01-19 13:10:18\",\"created_at\":\"2026-01-19 13:10:18\",\"id\":2376}', '45.64.160.213', 'Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/143.0.0.0 Safari/537.36', '2026-01-19 13:10:18', '2026-01-19 13:10:18'),
(35, 'System', 'System', 4, 'create', NULL, 'products', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'App\\Models\\Product', 2377, NULL, '{\"product_code\":\"P585608\",\"product_name\":\"DENTAL ZIRCONIA AIZIR APW9812SHT-APMA3.5 MULTILAYER\",\"slug\":\"dental-zirconia-aizir-apw9812sht-apma35-multilayer-P585608\",\"category_id\":\"314\",\"brand_id\":\"17\",\"delivery_target_days\":\"3\",\"flash_sale\":0,\"weekly_offer\":0,\"special_offer\":0,\"today_deals\":0,\"has_variations\":0,\"product_description\":\"<p>The <strong>Dental Zirconia Aizir APW9812SHT-APMA3.5 Multilayer<\\/strong> is a premium quality, CAD\\/CAM-ready zirconia disc engineered for high aesthetics and strength. Featuring a multilayer shade gradient that simulates natural dentition, this disc provides excellent translucency in the incisal region and robust strength in the cervical zone. The APMA3.5 shade offers a balanced, natural esthetic suitable for a wide range of restorative indications. Designed for seamless milling and sintering performance, it is ideal for crowns, veneers, inlays\\/onlays, and small bridges in both anterior and posterior regions.<\\/p>\",\"key_specifications\":\"<figure class=\\\"table\\\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Specification<\\/strong><\\/th><th><strong>Details<\\/strong><\\/th><\\/tr><\\/thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Product Name<\\/strong><\\/td><td>Dental Zirconia Aizir APW9812SHT-APMA3.5 Multilayer<\\/td><\\/tr><tr><td><strong>Model \\/ Code<\\/strong><\\/td><td>APW9812SHT-APMA3.5<\\/td><\\/tr><tr><td><strong>Material<\\/strong><\\/td><td>Multilayer Dental Zirconia<\\/td><\\/tr><tr><td><strong>Shade<\\/strong><\\/td><td>APMA3.5 (Natural\\/Esthetic Gradient)<\\/td><\\/tr><tr><td><strong>Disc Size<\\/strong><\\/td><td>\\u00d898 \\u00d7 12 mm<\\/td><\\/tr><tr><td><strong>Layer Structure<\\/strong><\\/td><td>Multilayer gradient (dentin \\u2192 enamel zones)<\\/td><\\/tr><tr><td><strong>Flexural Strength<\\/strong><\\/td><td>High (typically ~700\\u20131000 MPa)<\\/td><\\/tr><tr><td><strong>Translucency<\\/strong><\\/td><td>Enhanced multilayer translucency for esthetics<\\/td><\\/tr><tr><td><strong>Sintering Range<\\/strong><\\/td><td>Approx. 1500\\u20131570 \\u00b0C (dependent on furnace &amp; workflow)<\\/td><\\/tr><tr><td><strong>Fracture Toughness<\\/strong><\\/td><td>Elevated for durable restorations<\\/td><\\/tr><tr><td><strong>Indications<\\/strong><\\/td><td>Crowns, veneers, inlays\\/onlays, small bridges<\\/td><\\/tr><tr><td><strong>Compatible Systems<\\/strong><\\/td><td>Open CAD\\/CAM milling and standard sintering furnaces<\\/td><\\/tr><tr><td><strong>Key Benefits<\\/strong><\\/td><td>Aesthetic multilayer design, strong mechanical properties, predictable shade match<\\/td><\\/tr><\\/tbody><\\/table><\\/figure>\",\"packaging\":\"<ul><li>&nbsp;1 x ZIRCONIA AIZIR<\\/li><\\/ul>\",\"warranty\":\"<ul><li>Warranty is not applicable for this product.<\\/li><\\/ul>\",\"main_image\":\"2026-01-19-696ddd67b0a5f.png\",\"product_catalogue\":null,\"status\":1,\"actual_price\":\"11100\",\"sell_price\":\"11100\",\"available_quantity\":\"10\",\"stock_quantity\":\"10\",\"discount\":0,\"updated_at\":\"2026-01-19 13:14:43\",\"created_at\":\"2026-01-19 13:14:43\",\"id\":2377}', '45.64.160.213', 'Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/143.0.0.0 Safari/537.36', '2026-01-19 13:14:43', '2026-01-19 13:14:43'),
(36, 'System', 'System', 2, 'create', NULL, 'products', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'App\\Models\\Product', 2378, NULL, '{\"product_code\":\"P808960\",\"parent_id\":2373,\"product_name\":\"COPYPLAST \\\"C\\\" 0.5X125 MM RD\",\"slug\":\"copyplast-c-05x125-mm-rd-P808960\",\"actual_price\":\"1760\",\"sell_price\":\"1760\",\"available_quantity\":\"11\",\"stock_quantity\":\"11\",\"discount\":0,\"status\":1,\"updated_at\":\"2026-01-19 13:27:50\",\"created_at\":\"2026-01-19 13:27:50\",\"id\":2378}', '45.64.160.213', 'Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/144.0.0.0 Safari/537.36 Edg/144.0.0.0', '2026-01-19 13:27:50', '2026-01-19 13:27:50'),
(37, 'System', 'System', 2, 'create', NULL, 'products', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'App\\Models\\Product', 2379, NULL, '{\"product_code\":\"P778261\",\"parent_id\":2373,\"product_name\":\"COPYPLAST \\\"C\\\" 1.0X125 MM RD\",\"slug\":\"copyplast-c-10x125-mm-rd-P778261\",\"actual_price\":\"3040\",\"sell_price\":\"3040\",\"available_quantity\":\"11\",\"stock_quantity\":\"11\",\"discount\":0,\"status\":1,\"updated_at\":\"2026-01-19 13:27:50\",\"created_at\":\"2026-01-19 13:27:50\",\"id\":2379}', '45.64.160.213', 'Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/144.0.0.0 Safari/537.36 Edg/144.0.0.0', '2026-01-19 13:27:50', '2026-01-19 13:27:50');
