(175, 'System', 'System', 4, 'update', NULL, 'products', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'App\\Models\\Product', 2388, '{\"id\":2388,\"product_code\":\"P595823\",\"parent_id\":null,\"product_name\":\"Being Foshan Airotor Handpiece\",\"slug\":\"being-foshan-airotor-handpiece-P595823\",\"product_description\":\"<p><strong>Being Foshan Air-rotor Handpieces<\\/strong> are an excellent range of handpieces. Precision-engineered to offer the power and reliability required to perform clinical procedures. The new Ceramic turbine cartridge delivers increased smoothness, while the bur retention system has been engineered to securely retain the bur under increased torque loads. The Stainless Steel&nbsp;body of the airotor is comfortable in the hand and is angulated at the optimum degree for excellent direct visibility of the operating site, without compromise.<br><br>The high-speed handpiece is a precision device for the removal of tooth tissue efficiently and rapidly with no pressure, heat or vibration and cut the tooth-like butter. The mechanical instrument used to perform a variety of common dental procedures, including removing the decay, polishing fillings, performing cosmetic dentistry, and altering prostheses.<\\/p>\",\"key_specifications\":\"<p><strong>TECHNICAL SPECIFICATIONS OF STANDARD HEAD:<\\/strong><\\/p><figure class=\\\"table\\\"><table><tbody><tr><td><strong>AIR PRESSURE<\\/strong><\\/td><td>180-250 KPa (1.8-2.5 kgf \\/ cm2)<\\/td><\\/tr><tr><td><strong>WATER PRESSURE<\\/strong><\\/td><td>198Kpa (2 kg)<\\/td><\\/tr><tr><td><strong>ROTATION SPEED<\\/strong><\\/td><td>370,000- 420,000 rpm<\\/td><\\/tr><tr><td><strong>HEAD HIGHT<\\/strong><\\/td><td>&nbsp;13.14 mm<\\/td><\\/tr><tr><td><strong>HEAD DIAMETER<\\/strong><\\/td><td>\\u03a611.2 mm<\\/td><\\/tr><tr><td><strong>CHUCK TYPE<\\/strong><\\/td><td>Wrench<\\/td><\\/tr><tr><td><strong>BUR APPLICABLE<\\/strong><\\/td><td>\\u03c61.59mm~\\u03c61.6mm\\u00d721mm~23mm (diameter\\u00d7length)<\\/td><\\/tr><tr><td><strong