(25, 'stories', '[{\"image\":\"umesh_sir_picsart_aiimageenhancer.png\",\"name\":\"Umesh Agrawal\",\"designation\":\"Managing Director\",\"description\":\"<p>Welcome &nbsp;to <strong>Garg Dental Pvt. Ltd. <\\/strong>is Nepal\\u2019s trusted partner in advanced dental solutions. Established in 2002 and headquartered in Kathmandu, we are an&nbsp;<strong>authorized importer and distributor<\\/strong> of high-quality dental equipment, instruments, and consumables.<\\/p><h4>&nbsp;<\\/h4><h4>For over two decades, we have proudly supported dental professionals and institutions across Nepal \\u2014 providing them with reliable products that enable exceptional patient care. Our diverse portfolio covers every major area of modern dentistry, ensuring that practitioners have access to the latest innovations and trusted global brands.<\\/h4><h4>&nbsp;<\\/h4><h4>With a dedicated team of over 50 skilled professionals, Garg Dental is committed to setting the standard for dental supply and marketing services in Nepal. Our focus is on&nbsp;<strong>authenticity, quality, and service excellence<\\/strong>, and we take pride in delivering products that meet rigorous international standards.<\\/h4>\"}]', '2025-08-25 17:54:17', '2025-11-09 16:32:34');
